WEBVTT

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.500
What do we have here?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.680
Inui, Sarukawa, and Kijima 
from Nippon-ichi Tech?

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:12.150
You gots some guts there, I'll give you that.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.570
But it's the end of the line!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:18.530
Take this!

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.980
Hold on tight!

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.280
Excellent work!

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.710
I know your names now.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.720
Never bother the students 
from my school again!

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.450
Shut yer pie hole!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.680
Pie hole?

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.300
What is this, the 60s?

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.900
You ain't gonna get away with this!

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.470
We's gots Momoka-san backin' us up, see!

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.500
"We's gots"?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.570
People actually talk that way?

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.360
You sure you were born in the right decade?

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.110
Hold it, sister!

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.100
We ain't seen your face before...

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.540
Where you from?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:56.450
What's yer name?

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.780
Our name?

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.460
Kaimei Academy's Sket-dan!

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.290
I'm the leader, Fujisaki Yusuke!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.960
You got a problem with that, 
you're welcome any time!

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.180
We didn't ask you!

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.420
We asked the broad over there!

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.340
<i>You</i> didn't do jack!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:11.900
They beat you to the punch-line.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.960
Less work for me. I ain't complaining.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.590
<b>Episode 3: The Legendary Onihime!</b>

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:50.600
Well, well... Request 
resolved without incident.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.850
Way to hang in there, Miss.

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:54.530
Switch. Pelocan.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.740
Right! Will blue cheese 
flavor be acceptable, Miss?

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.580
Yeah, anyway, you sure are strong.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.610
With this guy, you could 
take down a grizzly...

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:04.860
No way in hell!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.580
It's strange for you to wield 
a hockey stick, though...

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.760
Well, I'm just used to it, I guess.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.720
It's always done me right, you know?

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:14.540
Cyclone is my trusted blade.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.630
So, you can achieve bankai 
and stuff like in Bleach?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.120
As if!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.420
Shut up already.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:23.400
Rather, it's more like the Cynical Stick 
of Magical Extortion Angel Reality☆Maji.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.700
Don't compare it to that.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.930
Man, such a pain... I'm heading home.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.460
Gonna hit the hay early.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:33.700
Oh yeah... You're ringing for 
the softball team tomorrow?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.400
Not sure we'll be able to make 
it to cheer for you, though.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.050
Sure. Though if you don't 
show, I'll kill you.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:44.100
Aww... But Switch and I are gonna finally 
decide who's the best at fighting games!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.820
I'll kill you, for real!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:46.830
Trusted blade?

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.160
Cyclone?

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.680
Okay! We'll report this to Momoka-san!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.550
Today will be sunny all throughout Japan. 
It's the perfect weather for sports.

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.550
What's with you lately?

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.050
How's that club going?

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.350
Oh, it's coming along.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:02.000
You know, I'm like, the leader and stuff.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.290
And people rely on you?

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:06.700
Yup! That's why I'm working on the weekend.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.240
Here, eat up.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.680
Thanks for the food!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.230
How is it?

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:17.520
It's not really good, but not bad, either.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.240
How should I put it...

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.530
Half-assed?

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:27.180
W-Well, I made it special 'cause 
you were up all night, sheesh.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:31.060
Morning, Leader. I'll take a 
café au lait and a croissant.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:32.150
We don't got any!

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:34.560
Leader, can you hand me that soy sauce?

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.730
Hey, are you guys making fun of me?

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.440
We're a family, <i>right</i>?

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.960
I'm <i>family</i>, right?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.090
So what's with the "leader, leader" teasing?

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.630
Fine then, "Dear Brother"... I'd like 
tropical fruit and a Bali-style brunch.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.720
See what I mean!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.830
I'm here, Captain.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:56.030
Himeko-chan! Thanks so 
much, we've been waiting!

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:58.070
Everyone, let's have a blast and win!

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.380
Yeah!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:02.230
So, which position? Where 
do you want to play?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.050
U-Uh...

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:05.730
You're the only girl in the 
Sket-dan, right, Himeko-chan?

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.350
What was up with that monkey the other day?

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.250
Now, now... Don't go 
burying her in questions!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:12.240
I'm gettin' kind of fired up! 
Thanks for having me, everyone.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.870
I'm sorry! Really sorry! 
I'm sorry! Really sorry!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.750
No problem! But in exchange, 
you need to be serious today!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.400
Oh? Look at the girls over there.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.380
Michiru-san, are you coming?

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:25.080
Who do you think is the reason we've 
come to school on the weekend?

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.650
Tell that to Agata.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.560
She's been saving up all the work.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.440
We have no choice but to follow her...

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.700
Why are there guys on the 
girls' softball bench?

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.100
Play ball!

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.510
Stop! Stop!

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:41.090
You! What is that?

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.100
That's not a bat! Are you screwing with me?

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.640
I'm not screwing with you! This is my bat!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.640
Time!

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:46.910
There a problem with that?

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.350
Are you some Amazoness?

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:51.770
On what planet do they play 
softball with a hockey stick?

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:52.990
Huh? What's that?

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.690
You don't believe in my 
Cyclone's power either?

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:57.880
All right! Just watch me! 
On the first pitch, I'll...

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.750
It's against the rules!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.210
Strike!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:07.320
I asked Himeko-chan to sub 
since she's so athletic,

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.610
but maybe I shouldn't have...

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:11.880
You give her too much credit, Captain.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.150
She ain't got smarts for 
anything but fighting.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.080
Strike two!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.970
Hey, Switch. Give her 
some advice or something.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:18.910
Time!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:23.210
Himeko, she's going to pressure 
you on the inside corner.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.460
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.040
In other words, it'll be toward your body.

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:28.690
Toward my body?

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.100
Where the hell is "toward 
my body" or "inside corner"?

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:33.880
Like, up? They're gonna 
throw towards the sky?!

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.880
Captain! SOS! SOS!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:34.450
Time!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.040
Hurry up, you people!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:36.640
Hurry up!

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.560
This is ridiculous. I can't bear to watch.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.850
The plan where I dress up as a girl 
and play would've been better.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.860
Oh, jeez! It's a pelollipop candy...

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:50.280
One time I sucked on one, I seriously puked.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.360
Maybe I'll try it, just to test?

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.750
Now that I'm an adult, there should 
be flavors I can stomach...

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.970
I'm the eternal challenger, right?

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.130
Salted fish guts flavor, huh?

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:02.830
Do or die!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.580
All right!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:09.260
Himeko-chan, you're amazing! 
It's an in-the-park home run!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.280
Throw it to home!

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.950
Where are you throwing?

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.440
Sorry!

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.240
Bossun! Are you okay?

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:23.520
I'm fine...

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.460
I can't believe you!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:30.350
Look at you! While I'm working my butt off,

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.380
you're stealin' my candies and pukin'!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.610
What the hell are you doing?

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:37.830
Well, I was, you know, curious...

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.640
I was like, "If she can do it, so 
can I!" You know the feeling...

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.300
What is wrong with you? Do you 
have to challenge everything?!

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.990
There's no need for that! Plus, that's 
the final Pelocan I was saving for later!

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:51.240
You'd better damn well eat the whole thing!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.110
Take responsibility and suck on it!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:58.600
Can we let it drop now? 
You won the game, so...

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:01.570
If I really eat this whole thing, I'll die.

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:03.500
What's that?

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.550
Are you gonna suck it or not?

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:08.210
Himeko-chan, don't! He'll die!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.990
What a pain.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.000
It's one physical job after another...

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.590
And my leader is an idiot.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.440
Oh, yes... Himeko-chan.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:20.730
Did you know? I heard a 
strange rumor the other day.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.050
What?

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:27.110
You see, I heard that "Onihime" was 
making trouble around town again.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.290
But that can't be true, right?

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:33.480
I mean, you're not like you 
used to be, right, Himeko-chan?

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:35.480
Yeah.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.620
Rumors always end up taking 
on lives of their own...

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:41.020
Maybe this is just proof that the name 
"Onihime" has really turned into a legend?

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.090
What the hell?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.590
Why are you eating it again?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.700
Well, I told you to, but...

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.960
I'll do it! I can do it!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:55.380
You're insane!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.630
Man, I'm seriously beat...

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:05.580
I didn't have any Pelocan, so I 
can't recharge to my usual self...

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:12.630
Oh, you guys? Want more 
of what's coming to you?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:16.580
Momoka-san told us to bring you to her.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.580
You's comin' with us!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:20.450
Hold it, there. Watch your tone.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.160
We ain't friends.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.780
And I ain't in a good mood.

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.420
I'm gonna wipe you out and then go home.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:31.180
If you think you'll win today, 
you've made a big mistake!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.270
"Ken-ken"?

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.010
You laugh <i>really</i> weird.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.010
This is gonna be a pain...

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.520
I gotta, though.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.560
You said I made a big mistake 
thinking I could win, right?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:54.360
My Cyclone alone is plenty to take 
care of the likes of you three!

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.520
I lost again!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:03.150
Can't you go a little easy on me?

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.720
I wanna say "Yay, I did 
it!" too once in a while!

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.720
Is Himeko-chan still here?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.480
She already went home. What's up?

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:10.530
She forgot this.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.540
It was left on the side 
of the gym storage shed.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:14.710
Huh?

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:18.050
Then, what did she take home?

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.430
W-What is this?

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:28.410
How do you like Magical 
Extortion Angel Reality...

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.660
Oops, caught her words...

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:33.270
...Reality☆Maji's Cynical Stick?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.650
And do you knows just how embarrassing it was

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:39.150
for us yankees to go and buy 
this thing at the toy shop?

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.030
Uh, no?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.090
We swapped it out!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.410
We's three were actually 
at the field with you.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.880
Pretty nice game you had!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.030
Get on with it.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:57.070
Then, after the game was 
over, while you were arguin',

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.050
we slipped it into your bag!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.710
Do you have any idea how much 
you've pissed me off now?

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:10.060
Crap... Fighting the three of them 
without my Cyclone is pushing it.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:12.880
Now, be a good girl...

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.740
...and come with us!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.720
Hey, let me go!

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.220
Where am I?

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.300
What the hell? What the 
hell is going on here?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:47.580
It's called "you're in some serious shit."

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.600
You the boss?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.820
Aww... Your face is so cute 
you couldn't harm a fly!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:59.650
Hmm, what was your name 
again? Momoka-chan, was it?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.620
Yes. I am Kibitsu Momoka.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.610
Also known as...

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.240
...Onihime.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:19.290
Sket Dance!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:25.050
The doors are closing on track 4.
The doors are closing.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:30.330
I'm sure you've heard the name, yes?

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:33.730
Blond... A cigarette in her 
mouth... Carries a bat...

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:36.220
I'm Onihime.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:37.980
Huh? Where'd she get off?

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:43.990
Oh? The Onihime I've heard about 
wouldn't do something this underhanded!

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:46.740
Underhanded? Fine by me.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:51.430
I make my prey cower in fear 
while I beat them to death.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:54.410
That's how I do things.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:58.330
As you can see, Onihime 
is cruel and ruthless!

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.880
She's a fearsome woman who'll do 
anything to defeat her enemies!

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.880
If you say so, but that 
ain't a real cigarette.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:08.000
It's some peppermint-flavored knock-off!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.410
Momoka-san believes in a healthy lifestyle!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.390
Cigarettes are bad for you!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.600
Plus, check out that skin, those looks!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.700
And she's cool, too!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.230
Plus, her happenin' style! And...

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.180
She's a little bashful...

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.090
That's also kinda cute...

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.000
We'll follow you forever!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.030
You definitely have spunk.

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:30.180
I'd like your name, before 
I send you off to hell.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.280
Who are you?

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.620
And if I refuse?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.430
I think her cellphone is ringing.

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:42.000
What kind of ringtone is that?

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:47.080
Oh? Fujisaki Yusuke... Isn't 
that the guy from yesterday?

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.310
It is!

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:50.400
Pick up!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:51.410
Hello?

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.640
Hey, don't just pick up!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:53.110
Oh, it's me.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.430
So like, you forgot it. You 
know, your stick, Cyclone.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:14:00.350
Sheesh... What'd you screw 
up and take home instead?

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:04.040
Reality☆Maji's Cynical Stick!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.020
Jeez, stop screwing with me.

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:08.440
Reality something's Magical Stick?

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:08.870
Cynical Stick!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.490
Shut up! Who cares one way or the other?

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.850
And wait, is your voice different?

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:17.200
It's kind of like... an animal?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.430
Finally noticed?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.850
We gots your woman, Sket-dan!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.070
Who are you?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:31.270
Wait, are you the three 
yankees from yesterday?

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:32.680
You know, the old-fashioned ones.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.790
Oh, shut it!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.060
The ones that looked like animals?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.460
Hey! Don't you care what happens to her?

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.180
Don't underestimate her! 
She won't go down so...

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.190
She is currently unarmed.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.490
Is she safe?

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:48.190
Oh, I wouldn't say that.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.550
The voice changed...

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:50.580
Are you their boss?

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.050
That's right. I am...

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:54.750
Wow, you have a really cute 
voice. Are you a voice actress?

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:56.300
Momoka-san, don't let it get to you!

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:59.290
But you <i>do</i> have a cute voice! 
Just don't let it get to you!

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:00.240
Momoka-chan, is it?

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:04.500
Sorry about this, Momo-chan, but 
could you wait until I get there?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.550
Where are you? Tell me the location.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.020
Hmph! It doesn't seem like you get it.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.860
This isn't a kidnapping.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.690
I just want to beat the crap out of her.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.010
She's...

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:23.200
Hey, give me a break here... The evening 
glow's here and the sun's gonna set soon.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:26.140
We won't do anything at all. We promise.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.620
You won't do anything?

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:31.280
What, do you think I was born yesterday?

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:35.410
The train on track 1 for 
Kobukuro is now departing.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.290
I've still got a lot of fun to have with her.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.710
Later, Prince.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:40.930
W-Wait!

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:42.250
Bossun!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.660
I know! Calm down...

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:46.090
We're going to save her!

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.190
I'm ready immediately!

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:52.090
Stay calm! Where do you think 
you're going in that getup?

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:56.140
Ah, this is no use! What's the point of doing sight gags when there's no one to overreact?!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.850
Yeah, yo! We need to calm down, yo! 
Gonna find out where she is, yo!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.980
Gotta calm down! Calm down, me!

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:12.700
This Onihime ain't all 
she's cracked up to be.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:18.200
Doin' stuff like this is just gonna give 
you more of a bad name. Ain't I right?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.430
A bad name is what I want!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:24.370
Onihime is a symbol of strength and violence.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.380
It's a name that spreads fear far and wide...

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.510
What strength?

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.850
Someone who can't even fight fair and square

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.970
shouldn't go bragging with 
such a grandiose nickname!

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:39.660
You're just lame.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.810
How dare you talk down to me?!

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.960
Maybe this is it...?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:50.770
Bossun!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.490
Die!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.230
W-Who's there?

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.750
Sket-dan-su!

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.750
T-The Sket-dan?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.990
Hey, were you just screwing around?

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:13.730
I certainly was not (asserting boldly)!

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:16.740
Come on, do this thing like we planned, okay?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.720
This is a really crucial part.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.590
Why, you...

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.680
Oh? Are you Momoka-chan?

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.810
Ooh, you have a cute face, too!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.490
Don't say any more!

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.950
Don't do it!

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:28.190
How did you find us?

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.480
You're the ones who told me.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.650
All I did was calm down and think back.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:39.780
Think back to the sounds I heard while 
talking with you on the cellphone.

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.510
Train...

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:49.920
Railway crossing...

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:53.050
The train on track 1 for 
Kobukuro is now departing.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.050
Near a train station?

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.820
Evening glow...

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.100
5 o'clock?

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:58.840
5 o'clock to Kobukuro...

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:01.680
A swing...

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:08.230
Switch! What are the stations where 
a train leaves at 5 for Kobukuro Station?

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.050
One with a railway crossing!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.760
Megishima Station.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:15.990
And is there a park next to it, with a swing?

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.240
Here.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.200
That's... impossible...

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.820
You remembered all the sounds?

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:31.830
What is he?

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:34.810
Sorry I was late.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.090
Here, I bought you Pelocans...

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.940
Wish you would've made it 
a little quicker, Leader.

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:44.040
I almost gave up on you there...

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:47.050
W-What? You three plan on taking us on?

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:48.200
Fine by me!

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.550
Hey, hey... Don't mistake 
me. We promised, remember?

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.500
I promised not to do anything.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.070
A-Are you nuts?

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:59.100
Oh, it's a liver-flavored one! 
This'll perk me right up.

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:05.060
Man, I feel alive again.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:07.970
Okay, yeah... This is what I'm talking about!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.380
W-Wait... Who are you?!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.720
A blond with a cigarette in her mouth?

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.770
It's a Pelollipop Candy!

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.460
And my weapon isn't a bat.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:29.060
It's my field hockey stick, Cyclone!

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:32.400
H-Huh? Then that means...

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:36.460
C-Could you be... t-the real...

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:40.440
Can't believe the rumors, can you?

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:42.280
O-Onihime!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.180
Onihime is a symbol of strength and violence.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.830
It's a name that spreads fear far and wide...

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:00.340
Strength... Violence...

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:05.220
Huh?

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.520
You have 3 seconds to get outta my sight!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.420
Right!

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.980
We're blowin' this joint!

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:21.570
Blowin' this joint?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:34.540
Yeah!

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:38.280
I thought if I lived life being honest 
with myself, I wouldn't have any regrets.

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.830
As if...

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:42.220
I got regrets... I got a load of 'em.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:46.490
I thought, maybe I've changed a little since 
you invited me into the Sket-dan...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.550
But in the end, I haven't changed a...

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:50.640
Stop whining, would you?

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:53.030
Just be yourself, that's fine.

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.450
Don't go changin' on me.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:59.710
I told you, remember? The Sket-dan 
needs someone as crazy strong as you.

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:02.970
I mean, you beat me over the 
head on a daily basis, right?

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.630
I would think it wise to have your 
brain examined, just in case.

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.750
Okay! I'll give you a Pelocan. It's 
mackerel miso-flavored! Eat it!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.940
You get durian-flavored.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.060
I really don't want one.

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:19.130
Don't be shy! There!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:28.390
Then, a can of coffee, 
unsweetened, that'll be fine.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.830
You really don't have 
to keep being my gofer.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:33.220
Anyway, stay safe out there.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:34.730
Yes, Ma'am!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:39.200
It seems like she took on the name because 
she revered the legendary Onihime.

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.360
The four have now become your followers! 
And they all lived happily ever after...

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.980
What kind of fairy tale is this?

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:45.880
Her legend is just gonna grow!

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:46.580
And make it quick.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.620
Right, Ma'am!

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:49.090
Oh, I'll have a cola.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:51.010
We ain't gonna listen to you!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.200
No, we ain't!

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.400
Hey, hand me that candy over there, Leader.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.460
Leader, buy me an iPed, yo!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.730
See what I mean!

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:31.630
Clubroom Talk Corner!

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:35.220
That's right! It's the segment filled 
to the brim with special info,

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:37.300
that's already become everyone's 
favorite part of the show!

00:23:37.300 --> 00:23:40.650
Hey, but you didn't say any 
information at all last time!

00:23:40.650 --> 00:23:43.560
Don't worry, there is 
plenty of time this week.

00:23:43.820 --> 00:23:46.470
I see! That's a load off, then.

00:23:46.470 --> 00:23:50.240
Okay, then! I'll tell you all 
kinds of information about the...

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.650
Time's up.

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:54.320
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:52.430
Hey!

00:23:52.430 --> 00:23:54.600
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:55.570
My Prince!

00:23:55.570 --> 00:23:56.660
Pelolin is...

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:58.050
What's with everyone?

00:23:58.050 --> 00:24:02.250
Let me explain! Pelolin is 
Pelollipop Candy's mascot doll!

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:05.790
And "finding" means to search for something!

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:07.900
Find my Prince!

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:09.030
Find Pelolin!

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:10.030
Please!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:15.340
Next time: Romantic! Finding 
the Hilltop Pelolin!

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:16.180
Let's go!

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:17.180
We're...

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:18.260
Sket Dance!
